# Page references and table of contents (reference/components/table-of-contents.md). Page area of 260 × 260
# from (20, 20); with FixedMetrics, each character measures 5 pt at Size: 10 and each line, 12.
#
# toc lists the headings of levels 1 and 2 (Levels: 1 2): Introducción, Método, Datos and
# Resultados, four entries of 12 pt, and not Fino, which is level 3. It measures 4 × 12 = 48 and leaves a
# margin of 8: intro starts at 20 + 48 + 8 = 76, and ref, which writes the page of results, right
# below, at 88 (with the 3 already written: "Véase la página 3." is 18 characters, 90 pt, one line).
# Each large heading goes in a block with Break: Before: page. Page 2: method at 20, data
# (Heading 2) at 32 and fine (Heading 3) at 44. Page 3: results at 20.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 300
		Margin: 20
	Title: Índice
	Language: es
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: TOC 2
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 10
	Section:
		Table of contents:
			Id: toc
			Levels: 1 2
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 8 0
		Heading 1:
			Id: intro
			Text: Introducción
		Text: Véase la página {page of: results}.
			Id: ref
		Block:
			Break:
				Before: page
			Heading 1:
				Id: method
				Text: Método
			Heading 2:
				Id: data
				Text: Datos
			Heading 3:
				Id: fine
				Text: Fino
		Block:
			Break:
				Before: page
			Heading 1:
				Id: results
				Text: Resultados
